# Reverse-engineering working material. Large (~612 MB) and reproducible:
#   .rea/app.asar           copied from /Applications/Claude.app
#   .rea/extracted-app/     unpacked app.asar
#   .rea/extracted-ion/     unpacked ion-dist.asar
#   .rea/bun-extract/       $bunfs module payload from claude.exe
#   research/claude-code/cli.js   the extracted harness JS (25 MB)
# The findings that matter are committed in research/*.md and docs/EVIDENCE.md.
.rea/
research/claude-code/cli.js

# Anthropic's proprietary variable fonts, copied locally from the installed
# Claude Desktop bundle so the UI can match exactly. NEVER commit these.
app/assets/fonts/
*.woff2

# Credentials: never commit a key. `xmonkey setup` writes ~/.xmonkey/auth.json
# (outside the repo); these guards cover the cases where it might be copied in.
auth.json
.env
*.key
*.pem

# Not committed:
#   node_modules/  Electron runtime (~260 MB), installed with `npm install`
#   dist/          the built .app (~260 MB), built with `npm run app:build`
#   .xmonkey/      local session transcripts
node_modules/
dist/
.xmonkey/
.DS_Store

# Local model weights (GGUFs pulled for Ollama) — large, not part of the repo.
.models/
